How to generate print_test.exe
------------------------------
Execute command from POS.

a) single .exe without a console window.
pyinstaller --clean --onefile --windowed --collect-data escpos Exploration\Printer\print_test.py

or

b) single .exe with a console window.
pyinstaller --clean --onefile --collect-data escpos Exploration\Printer\print_test.py

By default PyInstaller puts the executable here:
dist\print_test.exe

Finally, you may want to clean up POS\dist, POS\build, POS\print_test.spec

